3. THE LOSSES EACH FREQUENCY IMPLIES WITH THE DRAWN FETS (Q7 to Q10 CSD18510Q5B), SLUSE66A Equations 6 to 22
   Qsw two ways: TI's Equation 14, Qgd + Qgs = 49 nC (the maker's method when no Qsw is given), and Qgd + Qgs -
   Qg(th) = 34 nC (the charge past the threshold only; INFERRED as the lower bound). Ion = (REGN - Vplt) / (6.0 + 0.9),
   Ioff = Vplt / (1.3 + 0.9): Ion 0.493 A, Ioff 1.182 A. Inductor copper at DCR max, 25 C. Core loss: NOT COMPUTED (Coilcraft
   publishes it through its web calculator only, which is not held): INCONCLUSIVE, and it too rises with frequency.

